[I] A simple lightweight tool of fetching, filtering and delivering emails

[T] fdm is a program to fetch mail from POP3 or IMAP servers or receive
[T] local mail from stdin and deliver it in various ways. Rules in its
[T] configuration file match messages and deliver them to mbox or maildir
[T] folders, pipes or SMTP.

[U] https://github.com/nicm/fdm

